                 "lambda-mode-none-label" "lambda-mode-none-hint"
                 "lambda-mode-named-label" "lambda-mode-named-hint"
                 "branch-local-label"]
          :vals ["λ call-site parameters — what a HOF or a route fills per call when it hands this fn over as a callable"
                 " Derived" " — the compile picks the one unambiguous free arg; refuses when several qualify"
                 " None — []" " — everything is captured from the graph; the callable takes no per-call input (a handler chain)"
                 " These, in order" " — the listed free args are filled per call; the rest is captured"
                 " Branch-local — version rows of this fn stay on the branch they were written on; a merge never carries them"]}}
